ote.tm.vnm.1=§d✦ Where the six phases meet, the echoes of essentia are forged into eternal embers that light the void.
ote.tm.vnm.2=§b❖ When the Void's boundless psionic energy pours into the matrix, essentia becomes the ultimate energy source, recognized by reality itself.
ote.tm.vnm.3=§d You weren't supposed to see this§kasdasd§h.§kasdasdas.
ote.tm.vnm.4=§6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ote.tm.vnm.5=§6✦ STRUCTURE (WARNING: This structure is enormous and may cause a crash)
ote.tm.vnm.6=§bStructure §7 266 × 233 × 266; controller offset (133, 115, 129).
ote.tm.vnm.7=§bPlacement §7 Recommended controller height: Y=118. Leave a large, clear area around it.
ote.tm.vnm.8=§bOutput §7 Base parallel 2,000,000; generation accepts laser dynamo hatches only.
ote.tm.vnm.9=§bInput §7 At least one input bus or dual input hatch; essentia must come from the Advanced Essentia Stocking Input Bus (ME).
ote.tm.vnm.10=§bCharging §7 Host input energy hatches charge Psionic Modules only; they do not fund generation.
ote.tm.vnm.11=§bControl §7 Sneak + screwdriver toggles wireless output. Use the screwdriver to toggle item input after unlocking the corresponding node.
ote.tm.vnm.12=§6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ote.tm.vnm.13=§6✦ GENERATION FORMULA
ote.tm.vnm.14=§7Let A_i be the amount of fuel aspect i, H_i its heat, R = Σ(A_i × H_i), E = ΣA_i, and avgHeat = R / E.
ote.tm.vnm.15=§7H_i is the NEI aspect heat. Addon aspects that cannot be decomposed recursively still burn with an even six-phase vector.
ote.tm.vnm.16=§aBasePower §7= R / T
ote.tm.vnm.17=§aQualityMultiplier §7= 1 + 0.10 × ln(max(0.01, avgHeat / 40,320))
ote.tm.vnm.18=§aP_j §7= Σ(A_i × H_i × phaseVector_i[j])
ote.tm.vnm.19=§aD §7= clamp((Σ((P_j / R)^2) - 1/6) / (5/6), 0, 1)
ote.tm.vnm.20=§aPhaseMultiplier §7= 1 + B × (1 - D)
ote.tm.vnm.21=§7B = 1.00 with U11; otherwise 0.80 with U5 or U6 active; default 0.20. A Star Array round forces D = 0.
ote.tm.vnm.22=§aGloriaMultiplier §7= 1 + min(Cap, 35 × GloriaShare / (GloriaShare + 0.10))
ote.tm.vnm.23=§7GloriaShare = GloriaThermal / R; Cap = 4.0 with U19 active, otherwise 2.0.
ote.tm.vnm.24=§aEfficiencyMultiplier §7= (1 + 0.05×I_U2 + 0.10×I_U5 + 0.50×I_U11) × (0.20 if materialInputMode else 1)
ote.tm.vnm.25=§aOrdinaryMultiplier §7= 1 + Σ(activeNode.OrdinaryBonus)
ote.tm.vnm.26=§aSpecialMultiplier §7= Stabilizer × Potential × Cycle
ote.tm.vnm.27=§7Stabilizer = 1 + I_stabilizer × (1 + 0.5×I_U16); T1/T2 have a floor of 2.0.
ote.tm.vnm.28=§7With U18 active, Potential = 1 + 0.05×min(P,20) + 0.01×min(max(P-20,0),80) + 0.002×max(P-100,0); otherwise 1.
ote.tm.vnm.29=§7Cycle = 5 when U22 is active and the next round number mod 3 = 0; otherwise 1.
ote.tm.vnm.30=§aStructureDecay §7= exp(-0.6×(t-1)^2 + 0.7×G(t,1) - 1.1×G(t,2) - 0.2×G(t,3))
ote.tm.vnm.31=§7G(t,w) = (1/Z) × ∫[-0.1,0.1] exp(-(t-w-x)^2 / 0.1) dx; Z is the same integral centered at 0.
ote.tm.vnm.32=§7D_t is T1 2.013573, T2 0.182691, T3 0.074267, T4 0.004517, T5 0.000068.
ote.tm.vnm.33=§aStructureUpgrade §7= exp(1.0×I_U3) × exp(1.5×(t-1)×I_U2) × exp(1.6×(t-1)×I_U4)
ote.tm.vnm.34=§aPower_core §7= floor[(R/T) × QualityMultiplier × PhaseMultiplier × GloriaMultiplier × EfficiencyMultiplier × OrdinaryMultiplier × SpecialMultiplier × StructureDecay × StructureUpgrade × MaterialPenalty × BloodBonus × StarBonus]
ote.tm.vnm.35=§7MaterialPenalty = 0.20 only in material-input mode; BloodBonus = 1.15 when the round has enough Life Essence; StarBonus = 360 when a Star Array burns.
ote.tm.vnm.36=§aFinalPower §7= min(Long.MAX_VALUE, floor(Power_core × (1 + U26Bonus% / 100) × CatalystPenalty))
ote.tm.vnm.37=§6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ote.tm.vnm.38=§6✦ TIER STRUCTURE BLOCKS
ote.tm.vnm.39=§7Shape order is [C depth][B height][A width]; D glass may use any one allowed glass below and need not be uniform.
ote.tm.vnm.40=§6T1 UHV §7C Dragon Aggregate Casing(9) / D BartWorks Real Glass(6) / E Heat-Resistant Trinium Plated Casing(11) / G Tairitsu Advanced Casing(10106) / H GoodGenerator Magic Casing(0)
ote.tm.vnm.41=§6T2 UEV §7C Wyvern Aggregate Casing(10) / D BartWorks Real Glass(6) / E Heat-Resistant Trinium Plated Casing(11) / G Tairitsu Advanced Casing(10106) / H GoodGenerator Magic Casing(0)
ote.tm.vnm.42=§6T3 UIV §7C Draconic Aggregate Casing(11) / D Omni-Infused Glass(2) / E Heat-Resistant Trinium Plated Casing(11) / G Metastable Oganesson Advanced Casing(10111) / H GoodGenerator Magic Casing(0)
ote.tm.vnm.43=§6T4 UMV §7C Chaotic Aggregate Casing(12) / D Endless Psionic Crystal Glass(6) / E Gravity Stabilization Casing(0) / G Psionically Infused Reality Stabilization Block(3) / H Fusion Machine Casing Mk-IV(0)
