ote.tm.vnm.45=§7F and the Arcane Casings near the controller (X) are hatch-replacement positions. Auto-build places Bloody Ichorium blocks in the Psionic Manifestation Module slots (A).
ote.tm.vnm.46=§6━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ote.tm.vnm.47=§6✦ COMBUSTION CATALYSTS
ote.tm.vnm.48=§7Let E be the total essentia this round. All divisions use integer floor. Higher stages require all previous catalyst tiers as well.
ote.tm.vnm.49=§bUEV+ §fMolten Cosmic Neutronium§7: 144 × floor(E / 1,000) L. If insufficient, multiply total EU output by 0.60.
ote.tm.vnm.50=§bUIV+ §fSemistable Antimatter§7: 10 × floor(E / 1,000,000) L. If insufficient, multiply total EU output by 0.01.
ote.tm.vnm.51=§bUMV+ §fProtomatter§7: 1,000 × floor(E / 100,000) L; if missing, the round produces nothing.
ote.tm.vnm.52=§bUMV+ §fCreative Essentia Cell§7: floor(E / 100,000) items; if missing, the round produces nothing.
ote.tm.vnm.53=§bUXV+ §fMolten Eternity§7: fixed 6,000 L; if missing, the round produces nothing.
ote.tm.vnm.54=§bUXV+ §fCreative Essentia Cell§7: an additional fixed 64 items; if missing, the round produces nothing.
ote.tm.vnm.55=§cIf any critical catalyst is missing, CatalystPenalty = 0 and FinalPower = 0.
ote.tm.vnm.56=§7Per-node effects and tier unlocks remain authoritative in the Void Ascension Grid and are not repeated here.
