tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_1=Psionic Theory
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_1.description=For a long time, essentia has been regarded as a fundamental building block of our world. It can be extracted, stored, mixed, and used to change the form of matter.<BR>Yet we have never truly understood the nature of essentia itself.<BR>The six primal aspects are not entirely independent. There seems to be a subtle link between them, one that may hold more energy than anything we currently understand.<BR>We are no longer content merely to use essentia.<BR>We will try to understand it.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_1.effect=Unlocks the Void Nexus Matrix's basic power generation mode.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_2=Hyper Gaia Crystal Communicator
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_2.description=The power contained in the Gaia Crystal far exceeded our expectations.<BR>Using an Advanced Bio Processor to analyze its internal structure, we discovered that the crystal can link to distant energy sources. It appears to do more than store energy: it can somehow sense psionic activity across the entire world.<BR>If we can put this property to use in the matrix, we may be able to bypass many of the limitations of conventional power transmission.<BR>We are trying to send signals farther afield.<BR>We still cannot say where the reply comes from.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_2.effect=Increases base power output by 10%. Increases aspect combustion efficiency by 5%.<BR>Structure tier multiplier: exp(1.5 × (n - 1))
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_3=Endless Wand Charging
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_3.description=The current six-phase cycle has an unacceptable flaw: the wand's vis reserves cannot keep the matrix running for long.<BR>We have to stop the machine frequently, recharge the wand, and start it up again.<BR>That kind of maintenance is far too primitive for industry at this scale.<BR>Fortunately, Infinity Ingots will solve the problem.<BR>With an Infinity-reinforced charging system and Crystal Matrix Wand Caps, we'll no longer have to worry about replenishing the wand's vis.<BR>They'll become as permanent a fixture in the matrix as a bolt torqued tight.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_3.effect=The controller's wand no longer consumes any of the 6 primal types of vis.<BR>Structure tier multiplier: exp(1)
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_4=Blood Rune Economizer
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_4.description=Magical power does not always come from somewhere outside ourselves.<BR>Blood, magic, and essentia share a peculiar connection. Blood Runes exploit that connection, turning a process that would normally consume vast amounts of essentia into a more direct exchange of energy.<BR>At first, we were reluctant to use this technology in industrial machinery.<BR>But after a series of experiments, we had to admit that it works.<BR>Some costs don't disappear just because we refuse to acknowledge them.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_4.effect=The matrix can consume 1,440 L of Life Essence per tick for 15% more power output.<BR>Structure tier multiplier: exp(1.6 × (n - 1))
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_5=Beyond Dimensions
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_5.description=We can now reliably extract and convert the six primal aspects.<BR>Yet no matter how we improve the existing structure, the matrix's output always hits the same ceiling.<BR>After repeated experiments, we began to realize that the machine itself was not the problem.<BR>The space we inhabit may be the real constraint.<BR>If energy has to travel through three-dimensional space, why not try to find a fourth direction?<BR>There may be more space to explore beyond the world we know.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_5.effect=Increases aspect combustion efficiency by 10%.<BR>Raises the relative multiplier for tier 9 aspects to 1.8.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_6=Void Link Theory
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_6.description=We managed to create a stable fold in space inside the matrix.<BR>During one experiment, however, the energy readings suddenly changed in a way we could not explain.<BR>Some of the energy went missing without following its expected path.<BR>It seemed to have entered a region we could not observe.<BR>Further experiments showed that this was no accident. We had discovered a realm outside reality, and early results confirmed that we could establish a link to it.<BR>We call it the Void.<BR>From now on, we won't just draw power from our own world.<BR>We will try to reach beyond it.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_6.effect=When all six phases are perfectly balanced, the phase multiplier is B = 1.8 - 0.8D.<BR>Every 3,600 s of operation, there is a 45% chance that nearby players gain 1 temporary Warp.<BR>Unlocks Void Potential.<BR>Void Potential is an internal currency earned through the activities below and spent on branch upgrades.<BR>Gain 1 Void Potential per 7,200 s of continuous operation.<BR>Gain 1 Void Potential per 1G essentia consumed.<BR>Gain 1 Void Potential per 900 s of operation with all six phases perfectly balanced.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_7=Soul Moon Nest
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_7.description=The Void is not empty.<BR>After we established the first stable link, we picked up an unusual energy fluctuation.<BR>It had a distinct rhythm, as though some distant celestial body were breathing.<BR>More surprisingly, the signal carried a wealth of information about souls, memory, and perception.<BR>We tried to model its rhythm and built a structure capable of holding the fluctuation.<BR>We call it the Soul Moon Nest.<BR>Perhaps the Void has a moon of its own somewhere in its depths.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_7.effect=Doubles the heat values of the Time, Soul, and Stars aspects.<BR>Increases power output by 10%.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_8=Hungry Implement
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_8.description=Tools are an extension of civilization.<BR>From the first stone implements to industrial machines that can alter the structure of matter, we have always tried to impart our will to our tools.<BR>The Void seems able to sense that will.<BR>In one experiment, an ordinary tool produced a reaction far stronger than its materials alone could account for.<BR>We began to suspect that a tool's power comes not from the way it is built,<BR>but from how badly its wielder wants to use it.<BR>If we can harness that power, the machine itself may be able to surpass the limits of the tools we use.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_8.effect=Doubles the heat values of the Tool, Craft, and Mechanism aspects.<BR>Increases the matrix's power output by 10%.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_9=Life Weave
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_9.description=Life is an unusual phenomenon.<BR>It is neither a mere collection of matter nor an arrangement of energy that can easily be copied.<BR>From the earliest cells to complex ecosystems, life seems to follow a hidden pattern.<BR>In the Void, we found traces of that pattern.<BR>They resemble countless fine threads, woven together into a whole we can scarcely comprehend.<BR>We have begun to weave these threads into the matrix.<BR>A new possibility is taking shape.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_9.effect=Doubles the heat values of the Life, Mind, and Death aspects.<BR>Increases the matrix's power output by 10%.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_10=World Devourer
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_10.description=We discovered an ancient energy reaction in the Void.<BR>It has no distinct form and no fixed boundary.<BR>It does nothing but devour everything around it and assimilate whatever it consumes.<BR>No one knows whether it is conscious.<BR>Yet it seems to sense our presence.<BR>We tried to imitate its behavior and put it to work in the matrix.<BR>It was an extraordinarily dangerous experiment.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_10.effect=Doubles the heat values of the Gluttony, Pride, and Taint aspects.<BR>Increases the matrix's power output by 10%.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_11=Psionic Harmony
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_11.description=In earlier experiments, we tried to make every kind of energy obey the same rules.<BR>But the Soul Moon Nest, Hungry Implement, Life Weave, and World Devourer behave in very different ways.<BR>They defy easy classification, and we cannot force them to behave alike.<BR>The real problem was that we had always treated their differences as obstacles.<BR>But if these forces can coexist, can we make them work in harmony?<BR>We finally realized it wasn't the Void that needed to change.<BR>It was the way we understood it.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_11.effect=Phase multiplier: B = 2 - D.<BR>Increases aspect combustion efficiency by 50%.<BR>Increases the matrix's power output by 25%.<BR>Every 3,600 s of operation, there is a 75% chance that nearby players gain 1 normal Warp.<BR>Unlocks the Psionic Manifestation Module.<BR>The Psionic Manifestation Module can produce Manifested Psionics from 1 Shijima Ingot in 1,800 s at UIV voltage.<BR>Supply a Psionic Stabilizer to the matrix itself to double EU output per round.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_12=Moon Nest Contract
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_12.description=The Soul Moon Nest is not easily tamed.<BR>The power it carries comes from something beyond matter.<BR>We cannot control it directly, but we can try to form a bond with it.<BR>Once the contract is sealed, our relationship will be about more than supplying and drawing power.<BR>We give it a place to dwell.<BR>In return, it lets us reach deeper into the realm of souls and stars.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_12.effect=Increases the matrix's power output by 15%.<BR>Allows Molten Infinity to be fed into the Psionic Manifestation Module for overclocking.<BR>Each overclock consumes 1,440 mL.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_13=Implement Contract
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_13.description=A tool does not understand its own purpose.<BR>Yet over years of use, it takes on something of its wielder's will.<BR>We finally found a way to preserve that will and use it to reinforce the matrix.<BR>Once the contract is sealed, the machine will no longer rely on external tools to maintain its structure.<BR>It can become a tool in its own right.<BR>A tool that can generate power, transmit it, and keep improving itself.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_13.effect=Increases the matrix's power output by 15%.<BR>The Psionic Manifestation Module gains parallels equal to the host matrix's power output divided by (max × 100), rounded down, plus 4 additional parallels.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_14=Life Weave Contract
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_14.description=Life has never been a matter of simply existing.<BR>It grows, changes, and rebuilds itself through countless cycles.<BR>We finally understand what the Life Weave is for.<BR>It does not seek to create life.<BR>It gives what already exists a way to endure.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_14.effect=Increases the matrix's power output by 15%.<BR>Install Nanites of different tiers in the Psionic Manifestation Module controller for a 20% speed boost per tier.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_15=Devourer Contract
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_15.description=We no longer try to control the World Devourer.<BR>Rather than making it part of the Matrix, we will make the Matrix part of it.<BR>Once the contract is complete, the Devourer will no longer be merely a passive energy conversion module.<BR>It will seek out usable energy on its own and turn it into new power.<BR>All we have to do is make sure it still remembers where it belongs.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_15.effect=Increases the machine's power output by 15%<BR>Unlocks three additional Psionic Manifestation Modules
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_16=Enter the Void
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_16.description=We can now establish a stable connection to the Void.<BR>But contact has always been one-sided.<BR>We can observe it and draw on its power, yet we cannot truly understand it.<BR>We have begun experimenting with a different way to connect.<BR>Instead of continuing to send signals from our world into the Void,<BR>we will send part of the Matrix into the Void itself.<BR>The machine will no longer fully obey the spatial laws of our world.<BR>We do not know what lies on the other side.<BR>But we are ready.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_16.effect=Unlocks wireless energy mode<BR>Supplying Manifested Psionics multiplies EU output per round by 2.5<BR>For every 60 s of operation, there is a 100% chance that nearby players gain 1 permanent Warp
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_17=Earth Shaper
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_17.description=Matter is the most tangible expression of the world.<BR>Rock, metal, and even the tiny particles that make up everything seem to follow a common set of rules.<BR>In the Void, we found those rules expressed in a different way.<BR>Matter there does not always take a fixed form.<BR>By studying this phenomenon, we have learned to alter the composition of matter to a limited degree.<BR>If we can understand the force that shapes the world, perhaps we will no longer be bound by the forms matter already takes.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_17.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>Unlocks item input mode<BR>In this mode:<BR>EU output is reduced by 80%<BR>Aspect combustion efficiency is reduced by 80%<BR>Items can be fed directly into the machine instead of essentia
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_18=Outer Plane Guest
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_18.description=We have finally confirmed that the Void is not a single space.<BR>It contains many distinct regions.<BR>Each has its own spatial properties and laws of energy, and they may even operate on entirely different timescales.<BR>In those regions, we found traces of entities we could not classify.<BR>They seem never to have belonged to any known plane, yet they can move freely between them.<BR>We tried to trace their movements.<BR>Then, during one experiment, the Matrix received a reply from beyond our own coordinates.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_18.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>For Void Potential points 1-20, each point adds 5% to EU output and 5% to Psionic Manifestation Module speed (additive)<BR>Points 21-100 add 1% each<BR>Points above 100 add 0.2% each
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_19=Golden Dream
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_19.description=Gold has not always meant wealth.<BR>In the history of some civilizations, it stood for eternity, glory, and undying power.<BR>Deep in the Void, we discovered an unusual energy phenomenon.<BR>It links the value of matter and the memories of civilizations to a concept we can barely explain.<BR>We cannot say whether it truly has anything to do with wealth.<BR>But it does let otherwise ordinary matter release far more energy than expected.<BR>We call this phenomenon the Golden Dream.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_19.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>Multiplies the Terminus aspect's heat value by 4<BR>Raises the cap on the Gloria aspect's additional bonus to 2 times its original value
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_20=Endless Tide
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_20.description=Tides are an ancient force.<BR>They move oceans, redraw the edges of continents, and shape the lives of countless creatures.<BR>In the Void, this force seems unbound by space or distance.<BR>Energy flows, gathers, and disperses toward places unknown.<BR>We tried to harness this current to draw energy from the Void into the Matrix.<BR>The experiment succeeded.<BR>The energy never stops.<BR>It simply flows onward.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_20.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>Supply Molten Spacetime to overclock the Psionic Manifestation Module<BR>Each 1440 mL provides one overclock round
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_21=Vast Mountain
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_21.description=Mountain ranges are the world's oldest witnesses.<BR>Over the ages, they have endured countless changes and yet retained their shape.<BR>We found something similar in the Void.<BR>Some spatial structures there are almost impossibly stable.<BR>They are not immune to outside influences. They take every change into themselves.<BR>If the Matrix could do the same, we would no longer have to worry about what the Void's power might do to the fabric of reality.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_21.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>The machine no longer inflicts Warp on nearby players while running
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_22=Hollow Point
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_22.description=A hollow is not the same as nothingness.<BR>Under extreme spatial conditions, matter and energy can be compressed into states we scarcely understand.<BR>We found that shrinking a spatial structure in the Void into a small enough region yields an astonishing energy density.<BR>This is not compression in the usual sense.<BR>It is more like squeezing an entire world into a point that cannot be observed.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_22.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>After every three rounds of operation, the next round's EU output increases by 400%; the cycle then repeats
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_23=Empty Throne
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_23.description=A throne does not necessarily need a ruler.<BR>Once all the rules are in place and every command can carry itself out, the throne is only a symbol.<BR>We found structures in the Void that keep running without any outside intervention.<BR>They seem to need neither awareness nor anyone to direct them.<BR>The rules themselves govern them.<BR>We decided to bring such a structure into the Matrix.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_23.effect=Increases EU output by 20%<BR>The machine supplies 1 A of MAX per tick to the wireless grid even without aspect input
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_24=Dark River
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_24.description=In the deepest reaches of the Void runs a river no one can observe.<BR>It has no beginning and no end.<BR>Everything that flows into it gradually loses its original form.<BR>We tried to trace it to its source, only to find that the river does not actually exist in space.<BR>It is more like a process that never stops.<BR>Entropy, corruption, decay, and every irretrievable loss all seem to flow in the same direction.<BR>If we can harness that current, perhaps wasted energy need not be lost after all.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_24.effect=Increases EU output by 50%<BR>Every 360 s of continuous operation permanently increases Psionic Manifestation Module speed by 1%, up to 1000% of its original speed
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_25=Reforge the Void
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_25.description=We have explored several regions of the Void.<BR>We have seen matter shaped, space folded, and energy flow under different laws.<BR>It has gradually become clear that the Void is not a wholly separate world.<BR>It is more like a place where all possibilities converge.<BR>It has no fixed boundaries and need not obey any absolute rule.<BR>So why shouldn't we change it?<BR>We are no longer content merely to explore.<BR>We will try to shape the Void ourselves.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_25.effect=Supply Universium, Molten Eternity, or Molten Magnetohydrodynamically Constrained Star Matter to the Psionic Manifestation Module. Each 28800 mL/14400 mL/5670 mL, respectively, provides one round of extreme overclocking (8/4)
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_26=Whisper of Void
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_26.description=After we reshaped the Void, we began to hear something.<BR>It came from no known life form and carried no message we could readily understand.<BR>It seemed as though something was answering us.<BR>At first, all we could record were erratic fluctuations in energy.<BR>As we studied them, we found that the fluctuations seemed to carry a warning.<BR>They foreshadowed changes about to take place in the Void.<BR>We do not know who is whispering.<BR>But we have learned to listen.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_26.effect=Insert a Stargate Core Crystal into the host machine. The EU output bonus rises by 14% every 1145 s of operation, up to 1919810%. For every 10 s the machine is idle, the bonus drops by 1000%, down to 0. Removing the Stargate Core Crystal immediately clears the entire bonus
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_27=End of Reincarnation
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_27.description=Time is not a simple straight line.<BR>In the Void, we found that certain events recur in exactly the same form.<BR>These repetitions are not coincidences or replays of something recorded.<BR>It is more as though the world itself keeps returning to the same state.<BR>We tried to bring this phenomenon into the Matrix.<BR>If an energy conversion can be recorded, can it happen again?<BR>If a process can be repeated, must we pay the same price each time?<BR>We are close to an answer.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_27.effect=Allows the machine to burn Astral Array Fabricators.<BR>An Astral Array Fabricator is consumed alongside the aspects, forcing the round to last 3600 s and counting it as six-phase balanced regardless of how many aspects are supplied. Void Potential output for the round is multiplied by 4, and energy output is multiplied by 36000%.
tc.research_name.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_28=Find One's Own Path
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_28.description=We have mastered the laws of the Void.<BR>We can shape matter, cross space, manipulate energy, and even influence time to a degree.<BR>But all our research rests on a single premise.<BR>The Matrix must depend on the Void.<BR>It requires a connection, inputs, maintenance, and a steady supply of energy from outside.<BR>We began to ask ourselves a question.<BR>If the Void ever stops answering us, can the Matrix keep running?<BR>We tried removing every external command.<BR>We removed the preset connections.<BR>We removed its dependence on existing rules.<BR>In the end, we found a new possibility.<BR>The Matrix no longer needs to find a path into the Void.<BR>It can find its own way out.
tc.research_page.OTH_VOID_NEXUS_28.effect=Allows Void Potential to be withdrawn and deposited<BR>Unlocks advanced recipes for producing Manifested Psionics

