oth.essentia.research=Pipe essentia into an intake on the bottom cross. Use a single-aspect container on the intake to set its filter, or sneak with an empty hand to clear it. It stores 1,000 units. The 25 diffusion cells contribute 1, 2, 5 or 10 stability each. Each measure of fuel yields its adjusted EU value times total stability divided by 25. The dynamo emits whole amperes and carries excess energy forward.
