oth.essentia.reagents=Each family tries fluids in the order shown. Air uses liquid air ×1.5 or air ×1. Thermal uses super coolant ×9, cryotheum ×5, IC2 coolant ×1.5, ice ×1.2, distilled water ×1 or water ×0.5. Unstable uses xenon ×4, krypton ×3, argon ×2.5, neon ×2.2, helium ×2 or nitrogen ×1. Mechanics requires lubricant. These four families wait when their reagent is missing.
oth.essentia.reagents_extra=Other fuels can burn dry. Vital uses liquid XP ×2 or life essence ×6. Tainted fuels can release flux gas. Purifying fluid gives ×60 and suppresses flux, while liquid death changes yield and doubles the risk. Spirit and hollow tears scale with diffusion stability in opposite directions. Radiation accepts molten caesium ×2, uranium-235 ×3, naquadah ×4 or atomic separation catalyst ×16. Electric fuels scale by 3 to the power of the dynamo tier.
